‎	\setlength{\parskip}{0pt}‎
‎	\setlength{\itemsep}{0pt plus 0.3ex}}‎
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
